DESCRIPTION:The Martinsville Entertainment Theatre invites you to experien
 ce the inspiring true story of a young boy who looks beyond his small-town
  surroundings and discovers an extraordinary dream - building rockets. Oct
 ober Sky\, set against the backdrop of a West Virginia coal-mining town\, 
 is the powerful story of determination\, friendship\, family\, and the cou
 rage to chase a dream - even when the odds seem impossible. Movie begins a
 t 7 pm on Saturday\, September 26\; doors open one hour before showtime.
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre\, 36 East Morgan Street\, Mart
 insville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/movie-at-the-met%3a-october-
 sky/11840/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
